DISCLAIMER

This repository documents and re-implements, for research and local
interoperability testing, the client protocol of a third-party application.
It contains no assets, fonts, model weights, or proprietary code from that
application. All upstream services, content, and account data belong to their
respective operators. Do not use this project to operate a public service,
